# Concerted Effort ({2}{W}{W}): creatures you control gain protection until end of turn from whatever a creature you control has
# protection from - from creature types too (CR 702.16a; its ruling: protection from something spreads that something).
# Baneslayer Angel has protection from Demons and from Dragons, flying and first strike, so at Bot2's upkeep on turn 6 the
# Grizzly Bears gains all of them. Bot2's Nova Hellkite, a Dragon, then enters: its trigger has no creature of Bot1's it can
# target, so it deals nothing. It attacks and the Bears (flying now) blocks it: the Dragon's 4 damage to it is prevented, and
# the Bears' first-strike 2 is dealt.

